{"id":"en_no-mercy-for-my-ungrateful-son","title":"No Mercy for My Ungrateful Son","titleEn":"No Mercy for My Ungrateful Son","description":"Tang Wan, CEO of Wanfeng Group, is killed by her son Tang Zijie after she opposes his relationship with housemaid Bai Yulan. In death she learns that her husband Li Mingzhang has also long harbored resentment toward her, and she is tormented by Tang Zijie's complete lack of remorse. Fate intervenes: she is reborn on the day of Tang Zijie's engagement banquet. This time she refuses to accept betrayal, slapping him publicly, cutting all ties, and driving him and Bai Yulan away. She then names his ex-fiancée Ye Jiajia as the rightful heir to Wanfeng Group. Without financial support, Tang Zijie slides into ruin and even attempts to dine and dash at a high-end restaurant, only to be exposed and cause a scene—just as Tang Wan arrives with Ye Jiajia.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/no-mercy-for-my-ungrateful-son/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/no-mercy-for-my-ungrateful-son/en_US/cf4a25562a758e10/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Revenge","The Comeback","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlc32/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_no-mercy-for-my-ungrateful-son_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlc32/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_no-mercy-for-my-ungrateful-son_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlc32/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_no-mercy-for-my-ungrateful-son_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumbl